Comment: 50,0:23:53.08,0:23:53.12,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.63,0:00:26.26,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,The rain's not stopping.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.30,0:00:32.14,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But it kinda brings back memories.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.10,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.02,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The rain.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.56,0:00:39.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.69,0:00:43.31,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I remember that.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.17,0:02:31.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Aozono-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.55,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Kandachi-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.47,0:02:39.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's been a bit!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.72,0:02:41.89,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sorry for calling you out of the blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.35,0:02:43.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.98,0:02:45.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Here's the thing...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Do you wanna be idols with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.61,0:02:53.61,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Idols?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.61,0:02:54.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.40,0:02:58.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,My dream is to succeed as an idol!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.74,0:02:59.87,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's do it together!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.87,0:03:01.20,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,This is random.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.54,0:03:04.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's not random. I just haven't brought it up before!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.38,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Why me, though?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.38,0:03:10.96,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You know other people, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.42,0:03:12.67,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.34,0:03:18.39,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I mean, we've known each other\Nsince middle school, but we never talked.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.81,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,We've never shared classes even.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.56,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That doesn't stop us from being together now!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm just not interested.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.52,0:03:28.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Homeroom's going to start.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.58,0:03:41.70,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Aozono-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.70,0:03:45.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Any chance you could reconsider?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.91,0:03:49.21,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,This again? I already turned you down.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.38,0:03:54.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Then I'll just leave this with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.71,0:03:55.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.01,0:03:56.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Give it a look!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.22,0:04:03.22,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,A notebook?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.02,0:04:11.69,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Idols, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want our outfits to match!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.54,0:04:33.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,They said she was in the courtyard...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.71,0:04:37.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Aozono-san, are you here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Aozono-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.06,0:04:45.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.98,0:04:51.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck being an idol.\NYou can have this back.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.15,0:04:52.90,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Misfired...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.19,0:04:56.11,Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,You sure are something, Kandachi-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.03,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.03,0:05:01.28,Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,We were in Aozono-san's class in middle school,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.61,0:05:03.78,Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,but I could never talk to her like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.78,0:05:04.99,Default,Student 2,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.41,0:05:10.00,Default,Student 2,0,0,0,,She wasn't really unapproachable,\Njust so cool I felt nervous around her.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.37,0:05:11.87,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Nervous?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.63,0:05:13.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.84,0:05:17.63,Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm not sure,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.63,0:05:21.59,Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,but I guess you're just more inviting\Nthan us, Kandachi-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.18,Default,Student 2,0,0,0,,True that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.52,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,For my next plan...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.52,0:05:33.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,if only I could strike a conversation\Nwith her a bit better.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.40,0:05:38.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I just don't know when to bring it up,\Nsince she doesn't show any interest.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.66,0:05:46.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What does Aozono-san do in her free time anyways?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.20,0:05:51.37,Default,Acquaintance,0,0,0,,If you're looking for a cheap office,\Nthis is the place.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.00,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Looks worn-down.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.00,0:05:55.29,Default,Acquaintance,0,0,0,,Don't be picky. Let's go in.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.50,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.63,0:06:00.13,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,So it's about this big inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.13,0:06:05.72,Default,Acquaintance,0,0,0,,But seriously, you're finally getting a job\Nafter slacking off for so long?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.26,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.26,0:06:10.02,Default,Acquaintance,0,0,0,,I'd never have guessed you'd go into entertainment.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.02,0:06:12.52,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,My niece asked me to.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.52,0:06:14.77,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,So I'm just seeking a location for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.77,0:06:19.69,Default,Acquaintance,0,0,0,,Just the location? That sounds uninvolved.\NAren't you going to be president?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.86,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.28,0:06:24.78,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,"Here's what it looks like inside."
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.08,0:06:30.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry, I'm tailing someone.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.62,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Tailing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she going home?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.46,0:06:42.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.47,0:06:44.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I lost track of her. Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.22,0:06:53.43,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.31,0:06:58.27,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Potato salad, yakitori, and spring rolls, correct?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.27,0:06:59.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Aozono-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.03,0:07:02.94,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.20,0:07:05.78,Default,Shop Owner,0,0,0,,Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.78,0:07:06.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Um, yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.95,0:07:10.87,Default,Shop Owner,0,0,0,,We don't serve high schoolers. Go on home now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.87,0:07:18.25,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,So she has a job.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.38,0:07:27.43,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Toko.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.89,0:07:28.93,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.47,0:07:30.68,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.14,0:07:36.14,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,There's an information session\Nat your big sisters' university this Saturday,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.14,0:07:37.65,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,so keep your schedule open.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.81,0:07:43.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh? I was gonna go to a concert that day.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.69,0:07:46.36,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,You can go fool around some other day.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,No, I can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.74,0:07:53.24,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Please listen to me. This is for your own good.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.87,0:07:57.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.29,0:07:59.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about my own future too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.38,0:08:03.46,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Hey! Toko, come back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.80,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Where are you going this late?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.84,0:08:10.01,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm heading off now.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.64,0:08:16.77,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Are you done with your job? Good work.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.77,0:08:18.48,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Kandachi-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.48,0:08:20.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Is this an ambush?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.90,0:08:23.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,No, I swear!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.48,0:08:29.07,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I kinda might've run away from home...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.07,0:08:30.66,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I wasn't planning to visit.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.87,0:08:37.75,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Oh, fine. Do you want to go to my house?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.33,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Can I? Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.71,0:08:42.71,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.55,0:08:46.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.34,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Take a seat.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.22,0:08:52.22,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You really like clothes, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.22,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,No wonder, you're always stylish.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.22,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.06,0:09:00.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What with your earrings,\Nand the decal on your bag.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.56,0:09:03.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I've always thought you were cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.07,0:09:07.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,When we debut, you can be a model-slash-idol!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.99,0:09:11.32,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Stop that. I never agreed to go along with this.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.03,0:09:14.28,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm busy with my job,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.70,0:09:17.37,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,and I have housework to do too.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.37,0:09:20.29,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I just don't have time to be an idol.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.04,0:09:25.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That reminds me, why do you live alone?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.13,0:09:30.05,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,My family doesn't really get along well.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.55,0:09:36.72,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,So, why do you want to succeed\Nas an idol so badly?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.72,0:09:39.35,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Well, why wouldn't I want to succeed?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.35,0:09:40.56,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Not that part!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.56,0:09:42.39,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Why an idol specifically?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.56,0:09:44.98,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Because I like idols.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.98,0:09:46.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.57,0:09:53.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Seeing idols shine on stage gave me energy.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.11,0:09:55.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,They're breathtaking.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.16,0:09:59.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I want to be just like them.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.58,0:10:03.25,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Can't you do it on your own?\NYou could make it.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.59,0:10:09.51,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I wanted a friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.51,0:10:12.47,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Huh? But you have lots of friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.47,0:10:17.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I mean, I wanted a friend I could\Ndo the things I love with!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.93,0:10:22.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I have lots of friends at school...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.14,0:10:27.94,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,but Aozono-san, you're the only one\NI could ask to join me in my dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.74,0:10:36.07,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sorry I have to take up half the bed!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.07,0:10:37.49,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Don't jump.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.62,0:10:42.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hey, let's chat more.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.62,0:10:46.29,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're going home before school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.83,0:10:48.21,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.80,0:10:52.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.51,0:10:57.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hey, so...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.85,0:11:01.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up on you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.89,0:11:03.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Mind if I keep prodding?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.19,0:11:06.65,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Why does it have to be me?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.81,0:11:11.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Because I liked your face's profile.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.95,0:11:23.50,Alt,Toko,0,0,0,,She's perfect.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.38,0:11:30.42,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Are you asleep?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.42,0:11:33.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.14,0:11:43.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm home.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.52,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Sis, calm down.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.52,0:11:49.19,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Why should I? You know where Toko is, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.19,0:11:51.40,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I already told you, I don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.44,0:11:54.61,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.61,0:11:57.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,M-My friend let me sleep over at her place!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.20,0:11:59.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I-I better get to school. Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.91,0:12:02.49,Default,Toko's Mom,0,0,0,,Stop! Come back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.49,0:12:03.70,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Goodness gracious.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.63,0:12:16.34,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I've never used the other cups before.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.01,0:12:25.77,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,She's really angry at me...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.73,0:12:30.98,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Aozono-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.19,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Were you waiting for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.16,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'll be an idol with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.12,0:12:41.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.08,0:12:46.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.79,0:12:48.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.00,0:12:50.67,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,K-Kandachi-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.67,0:12:51.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.21,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.21,0:12:53.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's from my uncle.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.17,0:12:59.88,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't you know what you put me through?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'll apologize to him later.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.47,0:13:08.35,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,"Also, I found a space for the agency"!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.69,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is our agency!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.53,0:13:18.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,And I already have a good name:
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.45,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Production Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.53,0:13:23.53,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Why "Once More"?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.53,0:13:26.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good question...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.79,0:13:28.66,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's a secret!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.66,0:13:29.79,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.50,0:13:33.04,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Well, I think it'll do.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.75,0:13:36.30,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It all starts here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.30,0:13:37.42,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.84,0:13:41.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Uncle, you're our president! Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.34,0:13:43.80,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.26,0:13:48.68,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Hey, this place will lead us to our dream{ねぇ夢に続く場所がここだよ}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.68,0:13:52.60,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's start creating our future{始めるんだ僕らの未来を}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.60,0:13:56.57,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}No more reasons not to or excuses out of it{出来ない理由にやらない言い訳}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.57,0:14:02.36,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I don't want to hear it{もういらないの}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.49,0:14:07.28,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}For the future sky...{For future sky...}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.66,0:14:14.42,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}In harmony...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.67,0:14:23.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It's an invisible presence but I can feel it's there{目には見えない気配だけど確かに感じられるよ}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.97,0:14:29.35,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I have a hunch we're nearing the place you told me about{いつか話してくれた場所に近づいてる予感}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.52,0:14:33.35,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Even if I don't understand everything{分からなくても}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.35,0:14:37.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}If I make an effort to understand{分かろうとすれば君と}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.44,0:14:40.69,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Things will change for us{何かが変わる}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.69,0:14:44.91,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}So I want to know even more{だからもっと知りたくて}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.91,0:14:48.49,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}As time passes we'll worry and stumble{今を刻む僕らは悩み迷いながら}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.49,0:14:52.08,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}But even then we'll keep pushing towards the future{そうさ明日に何度でも焦がれていく}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.08,0:14:55.83,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}So from within today's light{今日の光の中で}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.83,0:14:59.75,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We'll reach out our arms as hard as we can{思いっきり手を伸ばそう}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.26,0:15:06.26,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Hey, this is where we'll follow our dreams{ねぇ夢に続く場所がここだよ}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.26,0:15:09.81,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's start creating our future{始めるんだ僕らの未来を}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.81,0:15:13.52,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}No more reasons not to or excuses out of it{出来ない理由にやらない言い訳}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.52,0:15:15.94,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm not hearing it, so{いらないから}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.52,0:15:20.48,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Yeah, I've been looking for a place to belong{そう 探していた居場所きっとね}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.48,0:15:24.07,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And I know I can create it if I'm with you{作り出せる 君と一緒なら}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.07,0:15:27.61,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Instead of following the values imposed on me{押し付けられた価値観じゃなくて}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.61,0:15:29.95,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'll take charge myself{自分の手で}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.74,0:15:34.25,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Remember what I said? I want to stay here forever{"ずっといたい"そう覚える？}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.25,0:15:37.88,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}That's basically a miracle{それがもう奇跡だよ}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.88,0:15:41.17,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I love this, so I won't back down{好きだから譲れない}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.17,0:15:47.26,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's prove that together{証明しよう君と}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.63,0:15:50.30,Default,Candic Thunder,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}In harmony...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.91,0:14:10.25,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's finally time.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.25,0:14:12.50,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,The previous group is done. Please come on stage.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.38,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.25,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.18,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.72,0:14:29.35,Default,Student 3,0,0,0,,Did you see her yesterday?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.35,0:14:30.72,Default,Student 4,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.72,0:14:33.35,Default,Student 3,0,0,0,,Wataya Rin-chan! She's super cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.69,0:14:36.36,Default,Student 4,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, she was on {\i1}Success Music,{\i0} right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.36,0:14:37.52,Default,Student 3,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.23,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}Happiness Music.{\i0}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.23,0:14:40.15,Default,Student 4,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.95,0:14:45.11,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,They're all just bandwagon fans.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.99,0:14:48.12,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,None of them really get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.62,0:14:52.12,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,There's so much more to idols than that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.00,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Not just what goes mainstream.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.84,0:14:59.92,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Oh gosh...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.55,0:15:02.26,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,They rock!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.52,0:15:21.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.03,0:15:26.61,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm beat.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.37,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I did terrible.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.33,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,No you didn't.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.33,0:15:35.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I tripped on stage.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.50,0:15:39.50,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,But I had fun performing with you, Toko.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Did you just call me Toko?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.30,0:15:45.26,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.53,0:16:06.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.71,0:16:19.79,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.80,0:16:33.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.60,0:16:36.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.27,0:16:38.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did you come from here...?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,U-Umm, it's a shortcut!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.61,0:16:44.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. You going to the agency?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.53,0:16:45.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.86,0:16:47.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Then let's go together!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Looks like the rain stopped.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.32,0:16:51.95,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.28,0:16:54.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's ice cream at the agency.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.66,0:16:57.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What would you do if there's only one?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We can split it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.17,0:17:03.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry that much.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't help it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.09,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's another day! Let's give it our all!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.63,0:17:10.26,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.01,0:17:12.14,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's up with you all?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.22,0:17:18.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It feels like our last concert\Nwas just the other day...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It {\i1}was{\i0} just the other day.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.06,0:17:23.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What about you, Asahi?\NWhy are you studying?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.86,0:17:27.53,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I have a test coming up soon at school.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.36,0:17:32.86,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Well, work is important,\Nbut you {\i1}should{\i0} keep up on your schoolwork too.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.37,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh, that's an odd thing for a president to say.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.66,0:17:40.33,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,You know that if your grades drop,\Nit'll be my fault, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.83,0:17:46.42,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Asahi-chan, good luck studying!\NI'm going to do a meeting in the back!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.42,0:17:47.42,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.42,0:17:48.80,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey now!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take it easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.18,0:17:55.72,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? Does this mean we're done for the day?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.72,0:17:56.76,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.26,0:18:00.02,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stick around for a bit\Nbefore I go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.31,0:18:05.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan, do you have time after this?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.40,0:18:06.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.98,0:18:09.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What a cute shop!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.66,0:18:17.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I never noticed it, even though\Nit's so close to the agency!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.87,0:18:18.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.66,0:18:21.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I found it a while ago,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.37,0:18:24.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,but they're usually closed when practice is over.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.50,0:18:27.04,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I really wanted to come here with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.84,0:18:28.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,With me?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.50,0:18:32.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You love sweet things, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.13,0:18:34.80,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.89,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,There's so many options, it's hard to decide.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.06,0:18:41.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.98,0:18:45.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll pick for you! Just wait on the bench, Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.65,0:18:48.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Uh, umm...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.19,0:18:49.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.11,0:18:53.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.82,0:18:56.74,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It looks delicious! Is this raspberry?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.58,0:19:07.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So spicy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.92,0:19:11.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay! My prank was a success!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.38,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.84,0:19:18.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I gave you a Firey-Hot Spicy Crepe!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.22,0:19:20.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.47,0:19:25.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A spicy crepe? Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.85,0:19:26.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No. You have to eat it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.31,0:19:30.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.07,0:19:32.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Is it really that spicy?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.95,0:19:38.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Eek, spicy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.70,0:19:42.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Can we even finish it...?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.83,0:19:45.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here, this one's sweet.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.67,0:19:51.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Then we'll both have half of each one.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.97,0:20:04.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were so mischievous, Lilly-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.68,0:20:09.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think I've ever seen you\Nangry before, Lulu-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.86,0:20:14.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I feel like we've gotten a lot closer!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.16,0:20:20.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I love your singing, Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.95,0:20:21.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.24,0:20:25.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's so much fun singing with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.54,0:20:28.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I love you too, Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait, not my singing?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.21,0:20:33.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Oh no, I love your singing too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.38,0:20:39.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I guess I oughta practice more.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's keep at it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.22,0:20:42.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.23,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.60,0:20:51.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What made you decide back then\Nyou wanted to be idols with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.69,0:20:54.23,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Back when?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I know you remember.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.94,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.94,0:21:00.74,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Ugh, fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.28,0:21:04.62,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I guess I was also looking for somewhere to belong.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.24,0:21:06.66,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.71,0:21:14.17,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I told you this before,\Nbut we wouldn't be here without you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.96,0:21:15.92,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Once More...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.69,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I want to stay like this forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.03,0:21:45.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.37,0:21:47.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.54,0:21:52.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.63,0:21:54.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.79,0:21:55.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.38,0:22:01.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I made a wish to the stars
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.38,0:22:07.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Up in the twinkling sky
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.85,0:22:12.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The clouds in the sky are so fluffy
