Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.31,0:23:43.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\c&HF18811&\bord3}I'm sure there's colorful, sweet spells in store{カラフルでスイートな魔法　きっとあるはず}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.52,0:23:47.03,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\c&HF18811&\bord3}Try believing it, and tomorrow will be a good day{信じてみてって　あしたはGood day}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.03,0:23:52.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur0.6\c&HF18811&\bord3}La la la, now we're smiling together, see you in the future{ららら　笑い合って　また未来へ}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:28.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Et cetera cera...{エトセトラ　セラ}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:30.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}(Et cetera ce...){(エトセトラ　セ)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.99,0:22:33.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Where do we start? (Do-re-mi-fa) We leave it up to God {どれから(ドレミファ)神様の言う(とおりじゃ)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.95,0:22:35.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}But that's boring{つまんないから}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.91,0:22:36.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}So if I decide for myself{自分で選んだら}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:39.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}Start piling things on and it'll start to move{あれこれ　乗っけて　まわり出す}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.47,0:23:01.06,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}If I peer into the hearts of people passing by{すれちがう人　心を覗き込めたら}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:04.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}What are they dreaming of? They're sparkling and shining{どんな夢をみてる？キラキラ光って}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:09.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Just like precious jewels {宝石みたいに　大切な}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:15.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}If the fragments of dreams scattered around the world{世界中散らばる　夢のかけらたちをね}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:15.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Could be lined up{せんぶ並べ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:22.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}And granted on the count of three, it'd be amazing{せーの！でかなえたら　アメイジング}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:24.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Dreams à la mode, for you{どりぃむアラモード For you}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:29.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}I'll make our planet into a great big dessert dish{この星はきっと大きめの　デザートディッシュ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:35.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Load it up with all your excitement, it's OK!{ときめきをありったけ　乗せてOK！なの！}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:36.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}Yes it is!{なの！なの！}
